{"parse": {"title": "Usurper (Founder)", "pageid": 527, "revid": 46640, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #ff000024; border-right: 4px solid #ff000024; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #ff002482 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #ff002440, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Unobtainable Unit</span><br />This unit is currently <span style=\"font-size: 105%;\">unobtainable</span> since <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log#_Update_19_-_Winter_update\" title=\"Update Log\"> Update 19 - Winter update</a></div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p><b>Usurper (Founder)</b> is a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span>. He is only obtainable by evolving <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper\" title=\"Usurper\">Usurper</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Evolving\">Evolving</span></h2>\n<p><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Usurper (Founder)</strong> can be evolved from <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper\" title=\"Usurper\">Usurper</a> with the following materials:\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table game-font-face\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Required Items:\n</td>\n<td style=\"display: flex; gap: 25px;\"><span>x1 <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper\" title=\"Usurper\">Usurper</a><br /></span><span style=\"display: inline-block;\">x3 <span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Path Branch\"><img alt=\"Path Branch\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/48/Path_Branch.png/revision/latest/sca