est?cb=20250416173207\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Usurper (Founder) Passive\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"103\" height=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Usurper (Founder) Passive.png\" data-image-key=\"Usurper_%28Founder%29_Passive.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/b7/Usurper_%28Founder%29_Passive.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/103?cb=20250416173207\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Usurper (Founder) can spawn 10 Wall Titans and 1 Usurper (Founder) upon using the ability. All titans spawned are capable of damaging Flying and Boss enemies. \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>Duration: N/A (it varies on the HP of the enemies and the timing)</li>\n<li>Cooldown: 480s</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h2>\n<p>Units sell for 25% of their deployment cost and upgrades.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>He is currently the most expensive unit in the game, racking up by <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">100,000¥</span> upon deployment, and with <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">1,050,000¥</span> when maxed.</li>\n<li>As of Update 19.0.0, Usurper (Founder) is now unobtainable as his raid has been removed.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261019101345\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.363 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.418 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1414/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 84469/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1607/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 7/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand si